Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:35.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:44.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:54.52,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:03.16,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:09.52,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:13.88,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:18.84,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:23.84,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:29.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:32.88,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:38.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:41.84,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:45.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:48.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:52.48,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:57.12,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:01.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:06.00,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:15.16,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Am I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:31.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,qualified enough now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.24,0:03:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator, wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Based on your strength, we are unable to stop you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,from entering the pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:41.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:44.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to ask if Fellow Cultivator has any connection with the Xu Family
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,of Planet Dong Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:49.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Fellow Cultivator Xu
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:50.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,is not from Dong Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,then on behalf of my Chen Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to invite you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:56.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,to become a non-family Elder !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Resources, spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.60,0:03:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will not be stingy !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:04.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pavilion's gate hasn't appeared yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The method to open it should be in their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time to complicate the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:12.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll discuss it after I leave the pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:19.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You two,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,help me to open the door !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,May Fellow Cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:53.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,obtain a celestial fate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,and return with a good harvest !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,this pavilion requires the combined efforts of multiple families to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The level of your celestial fate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:24.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,is decided by the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Touch my palm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,to test your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:46.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's beginning...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you really intend to invite him as a non-family Elder ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:49.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he joins my Chen Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:53.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like the two of you to pretend
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:05:57.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,what happened to Fellow Cultivator Yao
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:59.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and find another explanation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,to hide this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:04.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is he really worth your respect ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:06.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's courageous, resourceful,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and has powerful artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he can serve us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,that would be icing on the cake !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since he entered the pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:16.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,with a Corporeal Yang cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:18.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,he'll get spells of the fourth floor !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:23.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rank 8 Greater Celestial,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:25.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can enter the fourth floor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,to test your luck for a celestial spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems my cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,only allows me to enter the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we're talking about celestial fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,it might be worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:07.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings Celestial Lord, you can inspect the celestial spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:14.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder what celestial spell this person
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:16.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,will obtain on the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fifth floor !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,What !?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:22.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sixth floor !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seventh floor !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Eighth floor !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:31.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our families' ancestors who set up the pavilion's restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,only reached the eighth floor at best !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:37.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,has ever reached the ninth floor !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:49.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,What he'll obtain is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:51.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,celestial spells of the ninth floor !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:05.44,Spells,,0,0,0,,{\frz345\move(1275,608,1560,-55)}Call the Wind
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:06.08,Spells,,0,0,0,,{\frz345\move(1167,813,1560,-55)}Summon the Rain
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:06.69,Spells,,0,0,0,,{\frz345\move(1091,920,1560,-55)}Magic Arsenal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:07.00,Spells,,0,0,0,,{\frz345\move(1040,1020,1514,75)}Lands Collapse, Mountains Crumble
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:07.00,Spells,,0,0,0,,{\frz345\move(950,1100,1350,232)}Dark Moon, Clear Skies
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does this mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:30.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Illusions ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're all illusory objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Had I known this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would've gone to the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings Celestial Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can inspect the celestial spells
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does the word "inspect"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:53.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,have deeper meaning ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And where are
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:08:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,the celestial spells ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This painting isn't still !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:19.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nothing can be carried out of an illusion...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The secret
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,lies in this technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the tree from the painting !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:43.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,inside the painting !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.72,0:09:46.52,Spells2,,0,0,0,,{\move(944,319, 944, 700)}Call the Wind\N\NSummon the Rain\N\NMagic Arsenal\N\NLands Collapse, Mountain Crumble\N\NDark Moon, Clear Skies
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pavilion-opening ceremony is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.32,0:10:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:07.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:17.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Collection Pavilion ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:17.51,Pavilion,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(991,495)}Collection Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Ancient Thunder Celestial Realm !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:35.80,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1591,497)}Master Carefree\NRank 9 Celestial King
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:38.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:50.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never imagined
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I would witness Senior Master Carefree painting with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:53.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:55.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today really is a feast for the eyes !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:10:59.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Marvelous !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such abundant celestial spiritual energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:06.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The opening of the Collection Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a joyous occasion for our Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Celestial King Carefree,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:13.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,offer this painting as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this painting...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why isn't the boy there ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:21.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bai Fan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,now that you've become the Celestial Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Emperor !?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,you mustn't be stingy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:28.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,on a day like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:39.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to the Celestial Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:51.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1472,540)\fad(300,300)}Bai Fan\NThunder Celestial Emperor\NEarly stage Nirvana Void
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:49.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Carefree,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,your temperament
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:53.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,still hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:56.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I have contributed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.12,0:11:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,you, the Celestial Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:12:00.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,must also contribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:05.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,what do you think this painting lacks ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:06.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(327,514)}Qing Shui\NThunder Celestial Lord\NPeak late stage Nirvana Shatterer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.04,0:12:08.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,this painting has a tree but no wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.88,0:12:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its shape is complete, but not its spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why don't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:14.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,you give it a spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:15.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,with Call the Wind ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:19.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brilliant !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:25.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shall seal the Call the Wind spell in this painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:26.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll seal it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:28.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,on the ninth floor of the Collection Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:31.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The spell within the painting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.76,0:12:33.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the seal of the pavilion's core.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will wait for the fated one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:37.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to comprehend this opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,and inherit this spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:43.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you have entered this painting,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.96,0:12:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are the fated one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial spells are mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,They can summon the wind and the rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:53.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,turn anything into your soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,collapse the lands and crumble the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,or make a dark moon rise in a clear sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:00.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,My first spell
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is named Call the Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Call the Wind ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:07.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,what the wind is ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:18.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The greatest Daos are the simplest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:19.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wind
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,rises from a single reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems trivial and insignificant,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,invisible and intangible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,it can comfort living beings,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:32.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,nourish all things,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:34.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and even help life to proliferate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.68,0:13:40.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the power of the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,is by no means limited to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The power of the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,can extinguish the flame of all souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:50.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,break through the surface of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to shatter their bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:55.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1723,495)}Call the Wind\NCelestial spell
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:54.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,and scatter their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you are able to harness this power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:13:59.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,then you can
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Call the Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This wind...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:06.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not only tearing apart my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it's also
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,tearing at my Origin Soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:14.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,the power of Call the Wind !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:19.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether you can comprehend this Call the Wind spell
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:22.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,depends on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.56,0:14:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow Cultivator, your visit to the pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,must have yielded great rewards !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Would you let us have a look
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:44.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,at a celestial spell
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:46.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,from the ninth floor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:48.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Call the Wind...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,A celestial spell !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,He really got a celestial spell !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:14:57.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Having an extra Elder
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:14:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't as good as having a celestial spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,His mind must still be in a daze right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's a heaven-sent opportunity !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:05.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:07.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Steal the spell !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Call the Wind...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.80,0:15:37.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,What !?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:44.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nooo !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:53.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using Call the Wind
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:55.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,consumes too much origin energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perfect,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need these two's Origin Souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:06.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,to replenish my loss !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Continue retreating
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:11.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you might live !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:17.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's escape...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:29.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can negotiate...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:37.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,One more left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:41.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow Cultivator !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:42.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the four great families
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.76,0:16:43.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,learn of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,the consequences will be terrible !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.76,0:16:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spare my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I can cover for you !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:50.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Offend the four families,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you'll be as good as dead
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,in all of Allheaven !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The spell within the painting
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the seal of the pavilion's core.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The seal of the pavilion's core ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:14.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:18.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Collect !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:32.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since things have come to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:35.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have offended all four great families.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then I might as well
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,be more vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:42.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:43.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:45.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:48.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)\pos(1677,464)}a few days later
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.12,0:17:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:56.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,the four families will like this gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:00.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)\pos(1671,471)}3 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:00.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:03.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(274,533)}Lu Hecheng\NLu Family member\NIllusory Yin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:03.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1658,533)}Chan Pingnian\NChen Family member\NIllusory Yin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will surely reach the third floor of this pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take a stroll on the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:17.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's going on !?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:36.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:37.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who did this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fragment of the Collection Pavilion has been sealed off,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,outsiders won't know of the accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the four families' pavilion guardian elders are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:05.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the fact I stole the pavilion is exposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:07.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,they'll fight me to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can't stay here long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:17.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you really not going to the fragment with
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,celestial spiritual energy fluctuations ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:22.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's something about these fluctuations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,that feels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:26.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:28.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I finished my matters in the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.84,0:19:30.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,We should leave as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This trip has been bountiful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:33.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,thanks to Brother Li.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like the celestial spells of this Collection Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu, please keep them for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm too familiar with the saying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:43.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,"holding a gem brings calamities".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.48,0:19:46.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Besides, Brother Xu saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:47.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This small favor
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.32,0:19:48.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,is hardly worth mentioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,To leave the Thunder Celestial Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.84,0:19:53.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,we must go to the celestial gate at the far west
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:56.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,to open the passage with our Thunder Cauldrons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.40,0:20:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:01.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,no time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:08.04,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1648,536)\fad(300,300)}Celestial Welcoming Palace\NWestern fragment\NThunder Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:14.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's open !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:15.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get in quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:21.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The celestial treasure is mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Almost there...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's so close...
Dialogue: 100,0:21:01.20,0:23:35.24,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)}The cultivations families had classifications that outsiders didn’t know about. Like in the Alliance Star System, a rank 7 cultivation planet was the peak existence on the surface.\N\NRank 8 cultivation planets were very rare, so much so that the entire Alliance Star System only had three. As for the most mysterious rank 9 cultivation planet, there was only one in the entire Alliance Star System!\N\NThe cultivation families in the Allheaven Star System had similar classifications, but they focused more on history. Only long-lasting cultivation cultivation families could become an eternal existence in the Allheaven Star System.\N\NIn the Allheaven Star System, the most common were the cultivation families on the main cultivation planets of the four different domains. There was not much difference in their strength, and three or four cultivation families existed on each planet.\N\NAbove these cultivation families were the four great families with inheritances from the Celestial Realm. They were the most powerful force in the Allheaven Star System on the surface.\N\NAbove them are six families with even older inheritances like the Xiang Family of Planet Dong Lin and the Li Family of Li Yuan.\N\NJust like how the Alliance System had a rank 9 cultivation planet, the Allheaven Star System also had a family that had survived even longer than that. This was a family that had been around since the primordial times. The primordial cultivation family was the true powerhouse of the Allheaven Star System, and it was extremely mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:27.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Ask
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:25.68,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1514,677)}Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.80,0:21:27.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the perilous path filled with countless blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:28.96,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1299,685)}Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.48,0:21:34.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Can the mundane world be shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.84,0:21:32.28,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1557,705)\fad(800,000)}Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:35.72,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:34.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.76,0:21:40.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:39.16,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,638)\fad(800,300)}Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:42.36,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:40.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}stand in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:47.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.68,0:21:48.64,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:47.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:53.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:53.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.72,0:22:00.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:22:00.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:06.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.56,0:22:06.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.40,0:22:13.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:13.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.88,0:22:18.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.32,0:22:18.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:22.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:22.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:27.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:27.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:31.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.56,0:22:31.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:35.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:35.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.36,0:22:40.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.12,0:22:40.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:46.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:46.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
